 =\sum_{r=0}^{t-1}(a_rx^2+b_rx+c_r)\xi^r.                               \tag{3.22}
\]

Consequently the three coefficient series are simply
\(-\Pi\xi^{-2t-2}[x^2]\Delta_t^\sharp\),
\(-\Pi\xi^{-2t-2}[x]\Delta_t^\sharp\), and
