\(b_4=1,q_{2,0}=\cdots=q_{t-1,0}=0\) in (3.22) gives the promised finite
indexed definition of every leader scalar (2.4):

\[
 \lambda_{B}(t,r)=a_0\lambda_b(t,r)-\lambda_a(t,r)\lambda_b(t,0),
