+
+No ledger, jc2-lean, ideation file, or other running lane report is part of this work. Drivers and calculation records belong to `box/k16astra-20260905/`. Exact CAS jobs run in the foreground with `timeout 1800` and `stdbuf -oL`; total core use is bounded by five.
+
