    parts.append(f'\n**{tag}: {status}.**\n\n```text\n{markers}\n```\n')
parts.append(r'''
Any eventual dimension-zero result is eligible for characteristic-zero
promotion only by the properness theorem for homogeneous positive-weight
cones. The local coefficient ring is a localization of
Z[d,1/3]/(d^2-3) at (32003,d-31750). All fixed denominator integers are
smaller than the prime, y and g are nonzero, and each actual scalar
