+# K=16 structural atom: Astra, 2026-09-05
+
+Status: OPEN; working skeleton, not sealed.
+
+## Scope and provenance
+
+The objective is a uniform proof, for all t >= 3, of V0 or the sufficient radical-membership statement (8.1), with an exact residual if the uniform proof remains open. Frozen charged inputs in `/tmp/jc2-lane.vB6DJB/inputs` were verified mechanically from the lane receipt using awk and `sha256sum -c`; all sixteen passed. The generated manifest is `box/k16astra-20260905/input-manifest.sha256`.
+
+No ledger, jc2-lean, ideation file, or other running lane report is part of this work. Drivers and calculation records belong to `box/k16astra-20260905/`. Exact CAS jobs run in the foreground with `timeout 1800` and `stdbuf -oL`; total core use is bounded by five.
+
+## Statements and dependency chain
+
+Pending input reconstruction.
+
+## Structural results
+
+Pending proof and independent audit.
+
+## Exact controls and certificates
+
+Pending t=2 controls and t=3,4 exact calculations.
+
+## Residual and next step
+
+No promotion is claimed in this skeleton.
+
+## Fallacy audit and completion record
+
+Pending completion; the BODY-END marker will be added only after all jobs stop.

