+
+    w H = 3/(16y^4) * (x A^4-4B y^2 A^2-16y^3 kappa),
+    A=xC, H=(2xw'-w-B+2a)/x.
+
+If kappa != 0, gcd(w,A)=gcd(H,A)=1, H(0)=w'(0) != 0, and
