+## 2. Normalization, hypotheses, and the dependency to theorem (T)
+
+The original frozen constant row is inhomogeneous:
+
+    T_{t,0}=yg+tau_t, wt(tau_t)=4t+1,
+    I_{t,+}=(T_{t,1},...,T_{t,2t-1}),
+    J_tail=(T_{t,t},...,T_{t,2t-1}).
